# The service's runtime state. None of it belongs in a repository, and all of
# it lives on a mounted volume in production - these names are here as the
# second line of defence, exactly as the signing key's names are in the root
# .gitignore.
#
# codes-outbox.jsonl is the worst of the three to leak: it holds redemption
# codes in readable form until the vendor has sent them.
licences.db
licences.db-wal
licences.db-shm
codes-outbox.jsonl
data/
.env